  "readOnly": true,
  "description": "Read what needs the person now: one list of tasks across their websites, such as missing links, pages that are down, disavow uploads, renewals, internal link findings and edits to check, plan and payment problems, Search Console reconnects, agent access requests and setup. Each task says who can act, how it clears, where in the console it gets done and what an agent may do; agents draft outreach and never send it. Call it at the start of a session.",
  "examples": [
   {}
  ],
